@eventId=federa

### 🔥 ENDPOINT PRINCIPAL: JOIN Usuários + Reservas por Evento
# Retorna: usuários com suas reservas do evento "federa"
# @name users-with-reservations-federa
GET {{base_url}}/users/reservations-report?eventId={{eventId}}&page=1&limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Ver todas as reservas do evento federa
# @name reservations-federa
GET {{base_url}}/events/{{eventId}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Ver todos os usuários
# @name all-users
GET {{base_url}}/users/list-users?page=1&limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###
###

### 8. JOIN Usuários + Todas as Reservas (sem filtro de evento)
# Retorna: todos os usuários com todas as suas reservas
# @name users-with-all-reservations
GET {{base_url}}/users/reservations-report?page=1&limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

